				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h01r0301_fising_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほんじつの　テーマの　ポケモンは
[Name:PokemonName Idx="0"]　だ！▽
